        Total # of inputs        : 4
        Total # of product terms : 1
            Clock Enable: True
        Main Equation            : 1 pterm
        (
              !\UART_1:BUART:tx_ctrl_mark_last\ * !\UART_1:BUART:rx_state_0\ * 
              !\UART_1:BUART:rx_state_3\ * !\UART_1:BUART:rx_state_2\
        );
        Output = \UART_1:BUART:rx_counter_load\ (fanout=2)
        Properties               : 
